Package: jouriepi
Type: Package
Title: Deterministic Clinical Epidemiology and Biostatistics Engine
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-02
Authors@R: person("Ghaith", "Baccari", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "baccarighaith18@gmail.com")
Author: Ghaith Baccari [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Ghaith Baccari <baccarighaith18@gmail.com>
Description: Deterministic, offline-first statistical methods for clinical
    epidemiology and biostatistics, including contingency tables, stratified
    analysis, diagnostic accuracy, additive interaction, sensitivity analysis,
    outbreak curves and reproduction-number estimation. Functions return
    structured S3 results and have no graphical, browser or network side effects.
